<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S6.SS6" title="In VI Experimental Results and Discussions ‣ MECKD: Deep Learning-Based Fall Detection in Multilayer Mobile Edge Computing With Knowledge Distillation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">VI-F</span> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Discussions</span></span></a></li>
</ol></li>
